{"id": "Df6NVkRgC4X", "title": "Video by techtapri.ai", "description": "LeetCode ka sawaal PADHE BINA pattern kaise pakde? 🤯 Bas 3 cheezein dekho.\n\n1️⃣ CONSTRAINTS: N kitna bada hai?\n• N ≈ 10^5 → O(n log n) ya better\n• N ≈ 10^3 → O(n²) chal jaayega\n• N ≤ 20 → backtracking ka ishaara\n\n2️⃣ OUTPUT: return kya maang raha hai?\n• Saare combinations → Backtracking\n• Minimum / kitne tareeke → DP ya Greedy\n• Possible hai ya nahi → BFS, DFS ya DP\n\n3️⃣ INPUT TYPE (sab ise ignore karte hain)\n• Sorted array → Binary search / Two pointers\n• Substring → Sliding window\n• Grid → BFS / DFS\n• Tree → DFS\n\nTeeno jodo: array + saare subsets + N ≤ 20 = Backtracking ✅\n\n⚠️ Ye tarika tumhe 2-3 options tak laata hai. Aakhri faisla sawaal padh ke hi lo. Yahi asli engineer wali soch hai.\n\n📌 Save karo, next LeetCode se pehle kaam aayega\n💬 Comment karo: N = 10^5 aur sorted array, kaunsa pattern?\n📩 Ye reel us dost ko bhejo jo seedha code likhna shuru kar deta hai 😂\n\n#LeetCode #DSA #CodingInterview #DSAPatterns #PlacementPreparation #techtapri", "channel": "techtapri.ai", "uploader_id": "17669920072", "uploader": "TechTapri | AI Tools & Hacks", "timestamp": 1795062052, "like_count": 3, "comment_count": 18, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1773879000367436a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 53.914, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fvns4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMB4mbXsYZFwdSP218-dBBFZWnBENlDeJ_wRIENqS6r88B-p9iSQx8aK75uFeizDkXUOV5I3L7mgtE-16Xc7PtoyCGQuC74_prCXAQ.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=Ado5QBuPp7bv3t-5wxvlFbgoDC6SOdkF9hiIJPh5bgS-KL8vYPaI5cf2gm4YflfJg9ci008wvW0JZDQ7cLRkrweS&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fvns4-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=7KCw18k09VkQ7kNvwFiCTTf&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=3BFZogwliCELsaSAI8OINQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQjk3O8U52A7-EjUsimqSisz2wfzX1csJ7sO6djgBtd7g&oe=6B04BCD4", "manifest_